OL,5,G0000 Killer on the Run
OL,6,     FAfter a family wedding, an
OL,7,     F18-year-old is found tied to a
OL,8,     Fpole and her family murdered.
OL,9,     FDetectives pursue escaped rapist
OL,10,     FArthur Hutchinson, in a tense
OL,11,     Ftwo-week manhunt.
OL,12,G0100 Sleeping with My Murderer
OL,13,     FWhen a child finds her mother
OL,14,     FSuzanne Van Hagen dead, the
OL,15,     Fauthorities believe it to be a
OL,16,     Fsex-game-gone-wrong. It will take
OL,17,     Fher family four years to prove
OL,18,     Fthem wrong.
